n relevant"",""done"":true},{""text"":""Audit the existing 18-task Curator decomposition for atomic package ownership, complete accepted-contract coverage, dependency correctness, and executable Go/platform gates; do not duplicate tasks, correct only evidenced defects"",""done"":false}]","spawn queued: [analyst] solution-architect (codex) (run=RUN-260720-04218f, max_parallel=20)
