.resources/TASK-260720-poa3ze/TASK-260720-poa3ze_compile-only-build-drivers.md:679:The two managers may retain different home/cache/metadata names. Conformance fixtures address the entry by logical key and artifact-relative path, never by a literal `build-cache` or `.csk-build.json` pathname.
