.resources/TASK-260720-poa3ze/TASK-260720-poa3ze_review-cycle-3-verdict.md:26:The downstream `STORY-260720-35dck7` — Protocol schema v6 acceptance criteria require build sources to be excluded from agent context. Current protocol context selection admits entries under `agents/`, `references/`, `assets/`, `templates/`, `examples/`, and `data/`, excluding a subtree only when another rule such as `runtime_roots` applies.
